---
layout: base.njk
description: "Statistiska kuriositeter ur Allsvenskans historia sedan 1924: rekord, sviter, egendomligheter, derbyn och bortglömda anekdoter — uppdaterat varje dag."
---
<section class="hero">
  <h1>{{ site.tagline }}</h1>
  <p>Inga liveresultat. Ingen transferskvaller. Bara noga kontrollerad statistisk
     kuriosa ur {{ generated.meta.season_count }} allsvenska säsonger och
     {{ generated.meta.match_count | nf }} matcher.</p>
</section>

<section class="card featured">
  <p class="kicker">Dagens kuriosa</p>
  <h2><a href="/kuriosa/{{ daily.pick.id }}/">{{ daily.pick.title }}</a></h2>
  <p>{{ daily.pick.description }}</p>
  {% set c = daily.pick %}
  {% include "ctable.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="card">
  <p class="kicker">Denna vecka i historien</p>
  <h2>{{ daily.onThisDay.title }}</h2>
  {% set c = daily.onThisDay %}
  {% include "ctable.njk" %}
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Utforska kuriosan</h2>
  <div class="cat-grid">
    {% for cat in categories %}
    <a class="cat-card" href="/kategori/{{ cat.slug }}/">
      <h3>{{ cat.name }}</h3>
      <p>{{ cat.description }}</p>
      <p class="muted">{{ cat.curiosities.length }} kuriositeter</p>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
